(6619843, 988709, 124982, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this entry. I''ve voted it in my Top 3....although not sure I''d consider Jimi to be metal? Different strokes for different folks :) Anyway, that''s for another day...this is such a great image, very mysterious! Love the processing...quite perfect for the title!</td>', 'Absolutely love this entry. I''ve voted it in my Top 3....although not sure I''d consider Jimi to be metal? Different strokes for different folks :) Anyway, that''s for another day...this is such a great image, very mysterious! Love the processing...quite perfect for the title!', '2011-12-16 17:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6619845, 988318, 124982, '<td valign="top">Can I just say, these tones and colors ROCK!!! Just smoking!! Cant tell if the birds are part of the original image, or they were added in post..but that''s irrelevant! Top 5 for me...very nice!</td>', 'Can I just say, these tones and colors ROCK!!! Just smoking!! Cant tell if the birds are part of the original image, or they were added in post..but that''s irrelevant! Top 5 for me...very nice!', '2011-12-16 17:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6619846, 988434, 124982, '<td valign="top">Really liked this image...Top 5 for me! Only think I would''ve recommended twas to either lower the exposure, or do some more burning...but the image seems too light/well exposed for the title. I want something dark, dangerous, moody. Something that inspires fear. I think that little change would''ve made this image so much more impact. Nonetheless...Top 5!</td>', 'Really liked this image...Top 5 for me! Only think I would''ve recommended twas to either lower the exposure, or do some more burning...but the image seems too light/well exposed for the title. I want something dark, dangerous, moody. Something that inspires fear. I think that little change would''ve made this image so much more impact. Nonetheless...Top 5!', '2011-12-16 17:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
