(6620135, 988735, 141542, '<td valign="top">I am really impressed by this image.  It maintains photographic fundamentals while still being filled with such obvious artistic editing and vision.  The sky is so striking, subjects are clear, and the message is obvious.  All of this is done tastefully and correctly, making this my favorite of the challenge.<br/> <br/>Well done, 10/10.</td>', 'I am really impressed by this image.  It maintains photographic fundamentals while still being filled with such obvious artistic editing and vision.  The sky is so striking, subjects are clear, and the message is obvious.  All of this is done tastefully and correctly, making this my favorite of the challenge. Well done, 10/10.', '2011-12-17 08:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620140, 988729, 141542, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, a great image fundamentally with tasteful and reserved editing.  Excellent!</td>', 'Interesting concept, a great image fundamentally with tasteful and reserved editing.  Excellent!', '2011-12-17 09:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
