(6620144, 988651, 141542, '<td valign="top">I really like this, but I feel like it''s overwhelmingly blue.  I also wish the wings of the angel were not so...benevolent.  I realize that''s a bit intangible, but I think the image may have been better if they simply weren''t there, or were more sinister looking wings.  He''s more like Moth of Death at this point.</td>', 'I really like this, but I feel like it''s overwhelmingly blue.  I also wish the wings of the angel were not so...benevolent.  I realize that''s a bit intangible, but I think the image may have been better if they simply weren''t there, or were more sinister looking wings.  He''s more like Moth of Death at this point.', '2011-12-17 09:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
