(6620147, 988634, 141542, '<td valign="top">This fits with Dream Theater well.  Good entry.</td>', 'This fits with Dream Theater well.  Good entry.', '2011-12-17 09:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620148, 988663, 141542, '<td valign="top">A great image, but no surprises here.</td>', 'A great image, but no surprises here.', '2011-12-17 09:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620149, 988658, 141542, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting entry to me.  Not as foreboding as many of the others up front, but if you think of the catastrophic nature of water, and look at the growing swell here, you realize that this is truly a "heavy metal" shot.  Well done.</td>', 'This is an interesting entry to me.  Not as foreboding as many of the others up front, but if you think of the catastrophic nature of water, and look at the growing swell here, you realize that this is truly a "heavy metal" shot.  Well done.', '2011-12-17 09:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620150, 988714, 141542, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot with a well lit subject and a carefully chosen enivronment.  The main distraction for me is the amount of life remaining in the dead girl''s eyes.  She just seems too bright still...I know that''s a bit ambiguous, and I apologize.</td>', 'This is a great shot with a well lit subject and a carefully chosen enivronment.  The main distraction for me is the amount of life remaining in the dead girl''s eyes.  She just seems too bright still...I know that''s a bit ambiguous, and I apologize.', '2011-12-17 09:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620152, 988573, 141542, '<td valign="top">I have a bias for street, so I like this shot naturally.  The flare, to me, overwhelms a bit, but I also see how it''s key to what you''re doing here, and you wouldn''t want to downplay the great sky-light that''s creating the wonderful shadows you''ve captured.<br/> <br/>7 from me.</td>', 'I have a bias for street, so I like this shot naturally.  The flare, to me, overwhelms a bit, but I also see how it''s key to what you''re doing here, and you wouldn''t want to downplay the great sky-light that''s creating the wonderful shadows you''ve captured. 7 from me.', '2011-12-17 09:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620153, 988697, 141542, '<td valign="top">Creepy.  And that''s a good thing for this challenge.  Also, interesting and tasteful processing.  I say tasteful, because everything fits and adds to the image, as opposed to distracting from the real subjects.</td>', 'Creepy.  And that''s a good thing for this challenge.  Also, interesting and tasteful processing.  I say tasteful, because everything fits and adds to the image, as opposed to distracting from the real subjects.', '2011-12-17 09:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620154, 988636, 141542, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  I like the editing, it conveys your thoughts very well, without being ostentatious.  This wasn''t my #1 for Ace of Spades, but my #2.</td>', 'Awesome!  I like the editing, it conveys your thoughts very well, without being ostentatious.  This wasn''t my #1 for Ace of Spades, but my #2.', '2011-12-17 09:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620155, 988537, 141542, '<td valign="top">A good use of selective color, and an interesting and somewhat indecipherable item surrounding your lemon make this a 7/10 for me!</td>', 'A good use of selective color, and an interesting and somewhat indecipherable item surrounding your lemon make this a 7/10 for me!', '2011-12-17 09:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620156, 988725, 141542, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 7 simply for time spent, and an interesting take on the title of your image.</td>', 'I gave you a 7 simply for time spent, and an interesting take on the title of your image.', '2011-12-17 09:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620157, 988702, 141542, '<td valign="top">Hey bud, you went in a lot of great directions with this image, except one...the incredible amount of softness on the subject!!  What is up with that?  I see a dark and gritty surrounding, with a dark and gritty suggestion of heroin use in some crazy location, but the subject looks like some sort of angelic being who uses Curel really, really often.</td>', 'Hey bud, you went in a lot of great directions with this image, except one...the incredible amount of softness on the subject!!  What is up with that?  I see a dark and gritty surrounding, with a dark and gritty suggestion of heroin use in some crazy location, but the subject looks like some sort of angelic being who uses Curel really, really often.', '2011-12-17 09:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620158, 988717, 141542, '<td valign="top">There''s just a little too much going on in this image, I think.</td>', 'There''s just a little too much going on in this image, I think.', '2011-12-17 09:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620159, 988722, 141542, '<td valign="top">Very fitting for the title, but not as good as my choice for #1 after seeing many "Solitude" images.</td>', 'Very fitting for the title, but not as good as my choice for #1 after seeing many "Solitude" images.', '2011-12-17 09:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620160, 987872, 141542, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting piece here.  I think it lacks emotion, but I know you put a lot of work into it, or at least it appears that way.</td>', 'This is a really interesting piece here.  I think it lacks emotion, but I know you put a lot of work into it, or at least it appears that way.', '2011-12-17 09:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620162, 988515, 141542, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but the over-processing doesn''t compensate for the somewhat boring action figures.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but the over-processing doesn''t compensate for the somewhat boring action figures.', '2011-12-17 09:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620163, 988400, 141542, '<td valign="top">My favorite fade to black.  Some may consider this a shoehorn, but I hope you reconsider after contemplating this image for a minute.</td>', 'My favorite fade to black.  Some may consider this a shoehorn, but I hope you reconsider after contemplating this image for a minute.', '2011-12-17 09:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620164, 988315, 141542, '<td valign="top">Souls* and unfortunately I don''t think this shot makes the connection between title and subject matter too well.  Granted, these are twin towers, but I just wonder how these particular towers are related to 9/11.  Maybe I''ve proved myself stupid in saying that, I hope not, but all the same.</td>', 'Souls* and unfortunately I don''t think this shot makes the connection between title and subject matter too well.  Granted, these are twin towers, but I just wonder how these particular towers are related to 9/11.  Maybe I''ve proved myself stupid in saying that, I hope not, but all the same.', '2011-12-17 09:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620165, 988551, 141542, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but with an overwhelming vignette applied.</td>', 'Interesting, but with an overwhelming vignette applied.', '2011-12-17 09:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620166, 988688, 141542, '<td valign="top">A centered, OOF bird, standing on a dark rock next to some darkness.  Sorry, but this is a cut below the rest for me.</td>', 'A centered, OOF bird, standing on a dark rock next to some darkness.  Sorry, but this is a cut below the rest for me.', '2011-12-17 09:38:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6620167, 988685, 141542, '<td valign="top">FLAMES EVERYWHERE.</td>', 'FLAMES EVERYWHERE.', '2011-12-17 09:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620168, 988675, 141542, '<td valign="top">A really great shot, I think a ribbon may be inevitable for you!  How you achieved this, I have no idea, so I can''t say much from a technical standpoint other than your "image" seems properly exposed, haha.  I''m not sure how the song you''ve associated this image with goes, and I don''t exactly see the connection between title and content, but I think you''ve done an excellent job with this.</td>', 'A really great shot, I think a ribbon may be inevitable for you!  How you achieved this, I have no idea, so I can''t say much from a technical standpoint other than your "image" seems properly exposed, haha.  I''m not sure how the song you''ve associated this image with goes, and I don''t exactly see the connection between title and content, but I think you''ve done an excellent job with this.', '2011-12-17 09:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620169, 987879, 141542, '<td valign="top">I wanted to give this shot a 10, but I couldn''t, and the reason being is that it''s just not as creative as the Electric Funeral shot.  With that said, I find this image very striking and fitting with its title.  The high key nature of it creates a perfect juxtaposition between the subject and its surroundings.  Along with that, it''s incredibly creepy.  Maybe someone who is not afraid of spiders will rate this lower, but for me, it''s very solid.<br/> <br/>9/10, well done!</td>', 'I wanted to give this shot a 10, but I couldn''t, and the reason being is that it''s just not as creative as the Electric Funeral shot.  With that said, I find this image very striking and fitting with its title.  The high key nature of it creates a perfect juxtaposition between the subject and its surroundings.  Along with that, it''s incredibly creepy.  Maybe someone who is not afraid of spiders will rate this lower, but for me, it''s very solid. 9/10, well done!', '2011-12-17 09:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620213, 988725, 16046, '<td valign="top">Well played</td>', 'Well played', '2011-12-17 11:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
