(6620218, 988675, 16046, '<td valign="top">Nice could be a cd cover</td>', 'Nice could be a cd cover', '2011-12-17 11:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620221, 988709, 100831, '<td valign="top">Love the image... dreamy, cloudy... like the song, which I really enjoyed listening to. I''m afraid if I love it though, it may not be heavy metal but who cares. Jimi is such a fabulous guitar player.  8</td>', 'Love the image... dreamy, cloudy... like the song, which I really enjoyed listening to. I''m afraid if I love it though, it may not be heavy metal but who cares. Jimi is such a fabulous guitar player.  8', '2011-12-17 11:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620225, 988701, 100831, '<td valign="top">I went with Descending''s Descending so far as listening is concerned, although there were others. Totally wild vocals. Too much screaming. But as I look at this image, I get the feeling it too is falling/sliding off the page... it''s the shadows, I think that make it work for me. Good job.</td>', 'I went with Descending''s Descending so far as listening is concerned, although there were others. Totally wild vocals. Too much screaming. But as I look at this image, I get the feeling it too is falling/sliding off the page... it''s the shadows, I think that make it work for me. Good job.', '2011-12-17 12:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620231, 988532, 100831, '<td valign="top">Wow that music is really intense (can''t find a better word).<br/>I like the movement in the image and the stormy feel - definitely fits the title, as the challenge dictated. 7 for that. IMO it''s way too pretty for the song though.</td>', 'Wow that music is really intense (can''t find a better word).I like the movement in the image and the stormy feel - definitely fits the title, as the challenge dictated. 7 for that. IMO it''s way too pretty for the song though.', '2011-12-17 12:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620232, 987916, 100831, '<td valign="top">It appears that Moose Molten Metal is the name of an album with a collection of 10 songs by Canadian Metal artists - I''m not sure which one you''re referring to. As for the picture, it fits the title well. Great catch, actually, and I like the aluminum antlers. Very nice.</td>', 'It appears that Moose Molten Metal is the name of an album with a collection of 10 songs by Canadian Metal artists - I''m not sure which one you''re referring to. As for the picture, it fits the title well. Great catch, actually, and I like the aluminum antlers. Very nice.', '2011-12-17 12:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620237, 988732, 100831, '<td valign="top">The hand of doom. I remember listening to Black Sabboth''s drummer - he''s still a trip. For me, this image is gruesome but still pretty tame in relation to the music. Nicely creative though.</td>', 'The hand of doom. I remember listening to Black Sabboth''s drummer - he''s still a trip. For me, this image is gruesome but still pretty tame in relation to the music. Nicely creative though.', '2011-12-17 12:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620238, 988671, 100831, '<td valign="top">Interesting werewolf like image fits the driving rhythm and racing feel of the music.</td>', 'Interesting werewolf like image fits the driving rhythm and racing feel of the music.', '2011-12-17 12:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620239, 988551, 117804, '<td valign="top">Great picture!!!</td>', 'Great picture!!!', '2011-12-17 12:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620240, 988688, 117804, '<td valign="top">Would have like it less centered</td>', 'Would have like it less centered', '2011-12-17 12:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620241, 988713, 100831, '<td valign="top">Its A Long Way To The Top If Ya Wanna Rock And Roll - I know AC/DC is a metal group but this is much tamer than most of the songs I''ve listened to so far from the titles listed here in this challenge. That''s a good thing.<br/>I love the crazy effect of this double visioned image. Great details and silvery tones. Well done.</td>', 'Its A Long Way To The Top If Ya Wanna Rock And Roll - I know AC/DC is a metal group but this is much tamer than most of the songs I''ve listened to so far from the titles listed here in this challenge. That''s a good thing.I love the crazy effect of this double visioned image. Great details and silvery tones. Well done.', '2011-12-17 12:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620242, 988684, 117804, '<td valign="top">Fear is really present in that pic</td>', 'Fear is really present in that pic', '2011-12-17 12:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620243, 988714, 117804, '<td valign="top">Terrifying!..</td>', 'Terrifying!..', '2011-12-17 12:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
