(6620368, 988701, 96751, '<td valign="top">Untold stories in a single glance</td>', 'Untold stories in a single glance', '2011-12-17 16:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620384, 988738, 49018, '<td valign="top">Goes well with the concept and with a band that does well with concepts. 10</td>', 'Goes well with the concept and with a band that does well with concepts. 10', '2011-12-17 17:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620386, 988663, 49018, '<td valign="top">Ohh, our puppeteer again, still very scary. Love the image. My only remark  is that the song, which I love,  makes me think of masses of subtly controlled puppets, while the single puppet makes me think more of Powerslave (up Iron), but that''s just me :) 9</td>', 'Ohh, our puppeteer again, still very scary. Love the image. My only remark  is that the song, which I love,  makes me think of masses of subtly controlled puppets, while the single puppet makes me think more of Powerslave (up Iron), but that''s just me :) 9', '2011-12-17 17:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620387, 988426, 49018, '<td valign="top">Je dois partir..</td>', 'Je dois partir..', '2011-12-17 17:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620389, 988529, 49018, '<td valign="top">Sacrifice, is going on tonight :)</td>', 'Sacrifice, is going on tonight :)', '2011-12-17 17:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620390, 988675, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the artwork, but despite Eddie and supernatural is so much part of Iron Maiden visuals, many of their songs are, at least as I see it, much more about real life with no supernatural interventions. An Hallowed by Thy Name really is about the indifference of god, rather than his active interest in human sufference. But I love the bell touch :)</td>', 'I like the artwork, but despite Eddie and supernatural is so much part of Iron Maiden visuals, many of their songs are, at least as I see it, much more about real life with no supernatural interventions. An Hallowed by Thy Name really is about the indifference of god, rather than his active interest in human sufference. But I love the bell touch :)', '2011-12-17 17:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620391, 988736, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice image.<br/>It really makes me think of certain motown funk more than of Hendrix, but the lady is definetely foxy :)</td>', 'Nice image.It really makes me think of certain motown funk more than of Hendrix, but the lady is definetely foxy :)', '2011-12-17 17:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
