(6623115, 987872, 112739, '<td valign="top">Cool sun, really well done, but I don''t like the shallow DOF on the moon. Should be able to see the whole moon clearly. Otherwise a great entry.</td>', 'Cool sun, really well done, but I don''t like the shallow DOF on the moon. Should be able to see the whole moon clearly. Otherwise a great entry.', '2011-12-21 12:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6623116, 988675, 112739, '<td valign="top">Compared to the rest of the entries, this seems to be the best edit. But IMO it crosses into Digital Art and is a bit too far from photography as the rule set requires. No doubt a tremendous example of extremely creative work, but I think SC should consider a new category identified as "Digital Art" for works of this level.</td>', 'Compared to the rest of the entries, this seems to be the best edit. But IMO it crosses into Digital Art and is a bit too far from photography as the rule set requires. No doubt a tremendous example of extremely creative work, but I think SC should consider a new category identified as "Digital Art" for works of this level.', '2011-12-21 12:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
