(6624404, 988033, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love the movement in the figures in the front right- I also commend you for staying true to your style despite the challenge topic. well done.</td>', 'I love the movement in the figures in the front right- I also commend you for staying true to your style despite the challenge topic. well done.', '2011-12-23 12:14:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6624406, 988634, 53814, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work Deb! Congratulations!</td>', 'Beautiful work Deb! Congratulations!', '2011-12-23 12:18:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6624410, 988687, 54645, '<td valign="top">OK. I''ll take a crack at the score. . . I say you lost a 1/2 point for the guns at best. If one goes strictly by the title then yes it fits. However, it is too pretty and Mr. Rogers for Guns-n-Roses and heavy metal in general. No real feeling of angst or anti-establishment despite the guns, particularly son #2 and #4. Looks like he is playing and having fun.  You definitely achieved a cinematic look which is why you pulled a 5.3 and not a 4.8. I guess guns kill.</td>', 'OK. I''ll take a crack at the score. . . I say you lost a 1/2 point for the guns at best. If one goes strictly by the title then yes it fits. However, it is too pretty and Mr. Rogers for Guns-n-Roses and heavy metal in general. No real feeling of angst or anti-establishment despite the guns, particularly son #2 and #4. Looks like he is playing and having fun.  You definitely achieved a cinematic look which is why you pulled a 5.3 and not a 4.8. I guess guns kill.', '2011-12-23 12:38:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6624413, 988571, 11769, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, emotional expression. Beautiful stuff.</td>', 'Wonderful, emotional expression. Beautiful stuff.', '2011-12-23 12:43:22.000000', NULL, 0),
