(6624437, 988675, 112739, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Blue with this most amazing creation. Your skill and imagination continues to evolve and give all of us inspiration. Thanks for commenting on how this image came into being. Wonderful work as always Cristophe.</td>', 'Congrats on the Blue with this most amazing creation. Your skill and imagination continues to evolve and give all of us inspiration. Thanks for commenting on how this image came into being. Wonderful work as always Cristophe.', '2011-12-23 13:00:59.000000', NULL, 0),
