(6624456, 988033, 50864, '<td valign="top">Even better knowing the top squiggles aren''t a layer. Beautiful find and capture.</td>', 'Even better knowing the top squiggles aren''t a layer. Beautiful find and capture.', '2011-12-23 13:52:25.000000', NULL, 0),
