(6624481, 988675, 108580, '<td valign="top">Well done on yet another ribbon. What struck me (pardon the pun) was the final touch of the bloodied marks on either side of the inside of the bell, where the blood soaked head mask has hit either side during rings. Odd no-one else picked up this little detail or that you mentioned it in your comments. Une image très macabre. Joyeux Noël à vous et votre femme. J''espère que vous obtenez quelques dormir ce soir!</td>', 'Well done on yet another ribbon. What struck me (pardon the pun) was the final touch of the bloodied marks on either side of the inside of the bell, where the blood soaked head mask has hit either side during rings. Odd no-one else picked up this little detail or that you mentioned it in your comments. Une image très macabre. Joyeux Noël à vous et votre femme. J''espère que vous obtenez quelques dormir ce soir!', '2011-12-23 14:49:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6624484, 988684, 108580, '<td valign="top">Well done! Very OOB for a "floral" tog. Your "Moonlight Hunt" and "Dark Horses-2" stood you in good stead...</td>', 'Well done! Very OOB for a "floral" tog. Your "Moonlight Hunt" and "Dark Horses-2" stood you in good stead...', '2011-12-23 14:52:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6624486, 988532, 108580, '<td valign="top">Of all the blurred posthumous style images submitted on DPC this struck a note (pardon the pun) even without reading the title or knowing the song/band. It is possible to make it out. Well done.</td>', 'Of all the blurred posthumous style images submitted on DPC this struck a note (pardon the pun) even without reading the title or knowing the song/band. It is possible to make it out. Well done.', '2011-12-23 14:55:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6624489, 988738, 108580, '<td valign="top">WD on the HM. Hope you didn''t shoot this in a garage studio with the doors open and the ghetto blaster on full inviting the neighbours to look...</td>', 'WD on the HM. Hope you didn''t shoot this in a garage studio with the doors open and the ghetto blaster on full inviting the neighbours to look...', '2011-12-23 14:58:16.000000', NULL, 0),
