(6625040, 988687, 30982, '<td valign="top">Technically the image is fine.  Nice seamless integration of multiple exposures/scenes, and I like the framing quite a bit, actually.  The impact of a photograph, both positively and negatively, however, is more than the technical aspect of an image.  Sure, you can have a pretty picture of a flower - THAT will get judged on technicals because in general, unless one has phobia, flowers are somewhat emotionally neutral.  Introduce a controversial topic (and guns tend to be controversial) and now you have more than just the technical element.  Now you have to take the good and the bad of the emotional response.  And that''s a good thing, even if it does bad things to your score.  But like Ben says, this is too "pretty" for heavy metal, and definitely too pretty for the first title you chose (I did look up the lyrics to Scream Aim Fire) and not exactly suited to the the second title you chose.  But technically, the image is fine!</td>', 'Technically the image is fine.  Nice seamless integration of multiple exposures/scenes, and I like the framing quite a bit, actually.  The impact of a photograph, both positively and negatively, however, is more than the technical aspect of an image.  Sure, you can have a pretty picture of a flower - THAT will get judged on technicals because in general, unless one has phobia, flowers are somewhat emotionally neutral.  Introduce a controversial topic (and guns tend to be controversial) and now you have more than just the technical element.  Now you have to take the good and the bad of the emotional response.  And that''s a good thing, even if it does bad things to your score.  But like Ben says, this is too "pretty" for heavy metal, and definitely too pretty for the first title you chose (I did look up the lyrics to Scream Aim Fire) and not exactly suited to the the second title you chose.  But technically, the image is fine!', '2011-12-24 18:52:25.000000', NULL, 0),
