(6626080, 988714, 35086, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PennyStreet:</b></div><hr/><i> Alter of Sacrifice ... not like the church!!!!<br/>Reign in Blood. Maybe not enough in the image, IDK.<br/>Anyway, great planning and editing job. Works for me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Alter of sacrifice?  Are you sure about that?<br/> <br/><i>"Waiting the hour destined to die<br/>Here on the table of hell<br/>A figure in white unknown by man<br/>Approaching the altar of death"</i> <br/> <br/>I''ve been listening to this since I was like 10 years old, I hope I got it ''somewhat'' right. XD</td>', 'Originally posted by PennyStreet: Alter of Sacrifice ... not like the church!!!!Reign in Blood. Maybe not enough in the image, IDK.Anyway, great planning and editing job. Works for me.   Alter of sacrifice?  Are you sure about that? "Waiting the hour destined to dieHere on the table of hellA figure in white unknown by manApproaching the altar of death"  I''ve been listening to this since I was like 10 years old, I hope I got it ''somewhat'' right. XD', '2011-12-26 21:58:24.000000', NULL, 0),
